[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the semantics
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A node is **0** if it is not a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A node is **1** if it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A node is **0** if it is neither a downstream descendant of the perturbed node nor the perturbed node itself.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
