[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D is perturbed → D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is a descendant of D → A:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is a descendant of A → B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C is a descendant of B → C:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Result: `A:1, B:1, C:1, D:0` ✅
