[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is perturbed → A:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is a descendant of A (via A->B) → B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C is not a descendant of A (no path from A to C) → C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D is not a descendant of A (no path from A to D) → D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
