[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### **Candidate Graph:**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B → A  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C → B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C → D  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D → B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m This results in the following reachability:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **A** is reachable from B via B→A.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **B** is reachable from C via C→B.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **D** is reachable from C via C→D.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **B** is also reachable from D via D→B.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **C** is reachable from itself, so C is reachable from itself.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **D** is reachable from itself, so D is reachable from itself.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So, the reachability is:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A: descendants of B → B is a descendant of B (itself), so A is reachable from B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B: descendants of C → C is a descendant of C (itself), so B is reachable from C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D: descendants of C → C is a descendant of C (itself), so D is reachable from C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B: descendants of D → D is a descendant of D (itself), so B is reachable from D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Therefore:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is a descendant of B
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is a descendant of C
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D is a descendant of C
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is a descendant of D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So the reachability is:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A: descendant of B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B: descendant of C  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D: descendant of C  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B: descendant of D  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So the reachability is:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **A** is reachable from B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **B** is reachable from C  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **D** is reachable from C  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **B** is reachable from D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So all nodes are reachable from the perturbed nodes as per the perturbation observations.
