[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m #### **1. Perturb(A) -> A:0 B:0 C:0 D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is perturbed (so A = 0).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is not a descendant of A in the graph, because the only path is A->... but A has no edges. So B is not reachable.
