[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - We must check if B, C, D are descendants of A.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - In the graph, there are no edges from A to B, C, or D.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - Therefore, none of B, C, D are descendants of A.  
