[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - D → B → C (so C is a descendant of D),  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - D → B → D (so D is a descendant of B).  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - But there is no edge from D to A.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - So A is not a descendant of D.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - So A:1 is not consistent with D:0.  
