[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - **Edges**:  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m   - A → C  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m   - A → D  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m   - D → B  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
