[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is perturbed → A:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A has no descendants → B, C, D are 0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So the response would be A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0 → which matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
