[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m #### **Perturb(C): A:1 B:1 C:0 D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C is perturbed → C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C → B → B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C → B → D:0 (since D is not a descendant of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So the response should be:
