[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m   - C is a descendant of B (B->C) → C:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m   - C has an edge to D → D:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So: B:0, A:1, C:1, D:1 → **Consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
