[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B is perturbed, so B → 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From A → B, A is a descendant of B.
