[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D is perturbed, so D → 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From D → A, A is a descendant of D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From A → B, B is a descendant of A.
