[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - `A` is perturbed → `A:0`
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - `A` → `B` → `D` → `C`
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So, `B` and `D` are descendants of `A`, and `C` is also a descendant of `D`
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
