[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So, C → A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Thus, perturbing C would set C to 0 and A to 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Which matches:  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m **Perturb(C) -> A:1, B:0, C:0, D:0** ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
