[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### **Perturbation 1: Perturb(A) -> A:0 B:0 C:0 D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A is perturbed, so A is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From the graph, A has no incoming edges, so no descendants are activated.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Thus, B, C, D are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So the result is: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0 ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### **Perturbation 2: Perturb(C) -> A:1 B:1 C:0 D:1**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C is perturbed, so C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From the graph: C -> A, C -> D, D -> B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So A is a descendant of C, and D is a descendant of C, and D -> B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Thus:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - A:1 (descendant of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B:1 (descendant of D)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D:1 (descendant of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So the result is: A:1, B:1, C:0, D:1 ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### **Perturbation 3: Perturb(D) -> A:0 B:1 C:0 D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D is perturbed, so D is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - From the graph: D -> B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - So B is a descendant of D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m Thus:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So the result is: A:0, B:1, C:0, D:0 ✅
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
