[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - C is the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - According to the graph:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m      - C → D → A
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m      - So C → A, and C → D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - So when C is perturbed, D and A are downstream.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m    - Also, since C is the perturbed node, B is not directly reachable, but is it reachable?
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m      - B is not reachable from C in the graph.
