[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So D → A → B → C → D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So D is 1, A is 1, B is 1, C is 1.
