[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is A a descendant of itself? Yes, so A:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is B a descendant of A? No (A has no edge to B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is C a descendant of A? No
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is D a descendant of A? No
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
