[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is C a descendant of itself? Yes → C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is B a descendant of C? Yes: C->B → B:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is A a descendant of C? No (C->B->A, so A is a descendant of C)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m - Is D a descendant of C? No
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m So the result is: A:0, B:1, C:0, D:0 — which matches the observation.
