[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m ### Step 1: Analyze each perturbation and check if it matches the observed results.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3660498)[0m 
